sequenceDiagram
  participant Runtime
  participant WF as Recovery workflow
  participant Broker as Broker adapter
  participant Store as Coin Farmer persistence
  participant Domain as Domain invariants

  Runtime->>WF: Startup / reconnect / uncertain outcome
  WF->>Domain: Mark pair not trade-ready
  WF->>Store: Load versioned local snapshot
  WF->>Broker: Fetch balances, open orders, order history, fills, rules
  Broker-->>WF: Canonical facts + completeness metadata
  WF->>Domain: Validate identities, fees, reservations, balances
  WF->>Domain: Replay missing fills idempotently
  Domain-->>WF: Reconciled / mismatch / incomplete
  alt Complete and consistent
    WF->>Store: Persist reconciled checkpoint
    WF-->>Runtime: Ready only after explicit readiness checks
  else Unknown or inconsistent
    WF-->>Runtime: Remain paused; expose actionable reason
  end